# Heated uniformly over the whole width, the stack is one-dimensional: the temperature at any depth is the heat flux times the thermal resistance below it.
# Reference: the sum of thickness over conductivity, exact for this mesh.
title 2 um of oxide on silicon
grid dx=0.5 dy=0.25
window width=24 ymin=-10 ymax=2
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 2
heater h xmin=-12 xmax=12 ymin=1.75 ymax=2 power=0.1
probe mid x=0 y=0.875
probe low x=3 y=-9.625
expect response mid h 29.2343974 1e-7
expect response low h 0.105574324 1e-7
expect peak 5.94276342 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 2304
expect response mid h 29.2343974409 1e-9
expect response low h 0.105574324324 1e-9
